 "html": "<section class=\"section_about-hero\" id=\"hero\" data-frame=\"pilot-dossier\" aria-labelledby=\"heroTitle\"><span class=\"ab_frame-label\" data-frame-label=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\">▢ pilot-dossier</span><div class=\"padding-global\"><div class=\"container-large\"><div class=\"ab_dbh\"><div class=\"ab_planet is-dbh is-pilot\" data-planet=\"gas\" data-seed=\"61\" data-colors=\"#2a0d04,#8a2c0c,#ff6a3d,#ffb27a,#ffe6cf,#c2451a\" data-ring=\"#ffd9b8,#ff6a3d,#b8431c\" data-tilt=\"16\" data-open=\".22\" data-spin=\"70\" data-glow=\"rgba(255,106,61,.45)\" data-drag=\"\" data-label=\"Home planet with two moons: my wife and my son\" data-pilot-planet=\"\"></div><div class=\"ab_dbh_top\"><div class=\"ab_crumb text-style-mono\"><a class=\"ab_crumb_link\" href=\"/\">/home</a> / <span class=\"ab_crumb_current\">about</span></div><div class=\"ab_rec text-style-mono\"><span class=\"ab_rec_dot\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>Crew file · rec 001</div></div><div class=\"ab_about-hero_grid\"><div class=\"ab_about-hero_copy\"><div class=\"ab_dbh_eyebrow text-style-mono\">Pilot dossier · designer + developer</div><h1 class=\"ab_dbh_title\" id=\"heroTitle\"><span class=\"ab_dbh_word\">Meet the</span> <span class=\"ab_dbh_word t-outline\">pilot</span></h1><p class=\"ab_dbh_sum\">Hi, I’m Angelino. I’m a self-taught designer and developer with a philosophy degree, a soft spot for space and a habit of asking <span class=\"ab_em\">why</span> before <span class=\"ab_em\">how</span>.</p><div class=\"ab_about-hero_cta\"><a class=\"button is-primary\" href=\"/#launch\" data-magnetic=\"\"><span class=\"ab_button-shine\"></span><span class=\"ab_button-label\">Plan a mission</span><span class=\"ab_button-arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">→</span></a><a class=\"button is-ghost\" href=\"/work\" data-magnetic=\"\"><span class=\"ab_button-label\">See the work</span></a></div></div><div class=\"ab_badge_wrap\" data-badge-wrap=\"\"><div class=\"ab_badge_lanyard\" data-badge-lanyard=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"ab_badge_clip\"></div></div><div class=\"ab_badge_rig\" data-badge-rig=\"\"><div class=\"ab_badge_swing\"><div class=\"ab_badge\" data-badge=\"\" data-selectable=\"\" data-name=\"Component / crew-badge\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"button\" aria-label=\"Crew badge. Press to flip it over.\"><div class=\"ab_badge_inner\"><div class=\"ab_badge_face is-front\"><div class=\"ab_badge_slot\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div><div class=\"ab_badge_head\"><div class=\"ab_badge_head-text\">Crew ID · <span class=\"ab_badge_id\">AB-001</span></div><div class=\"ab_badge_mark\" data-about-mark=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div></div><div class=\"ab_badge_photo\" data-badge-photo=\"\"><div class=\"ab_badge_sil\" data-about-sil=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div><div class=\"ab_badge_ph-t\">Headshot · 4:5 · incoming</div><div class=\"ab_badge_ph-s\">4 : 5</div><div class=\"ab_badge_cx is-a\"></div><div class=\"ab_badge_cx is-b\"></div><div class=\"ab_badge_cx is-c\"></div><div class=\"ab_badge_cx is-d\"></div><div class=\"ab_badge_scan\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div></div><div class=\"ab_badge_name\">Angelino<br>Barajas</div><div class=\"ab_badge_fields\"><div class=\"ab_badge_field\"><div class=\"ab_badge_dt\">Role</div><div class=\"ab_badge_dd\">Designer + developer</div></div><div class=\"ab_badge_field\"><div class=\"ab_badge_dt\">Training</div><div class=\"ab_badge_dd\">Self-taught</div></div><div class=\"ab_badge_field\"><div class=\"ab_badge_dt\">Degree</div><div class=\"ab_badge_dd\">Philosophy</div></div><div class=\"ab_badge_field\"><div class=\"ab_badge_dt\">Crew</div><div class=\"ab_badge_dd\">Spouse + 1 cadet</div></div></div><div class=\"ab_badge_foot\"><div class=\"ab_badge_barcode\" data-about-barcode=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div><div class=\"ab_badge_clear\">Clearance<br>Good missions only</div></div></div><div class=\"ab_badge_face is-back\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"ab_badge_slot\"></div><div class=\"ab_badge_back\"><h3 class=\"ab_badge_back-title\">If found, return to mission control</h3><p class=\"ab_badge_back-text\">This pilot runs on curiosity, big questions and one more chapter before bed.</p><ul class=\"ab_badge_list\"><li class=\"ab_badge_li\"><span>Favorite film</span><span class=\"ab_badge_li-v\">Interstellar</span></li><li class=\"ab_badge_li\"><span>Re-reading</span><span class=\"ab_badge_li-v\">Thus Spoke Zarathustra</span></li><li class=\"ab_badge_li\"><span>Side quest</span><span class=\"ab_badge_li-v\">Games</span></li><li class=\"ab_badge_li\"><span>Home base</span><span class=\"ab_badge_li-v\">Crew of three</span></li><li class=\"ab_badge_li\"><span>Status</span><span class=\"ab_badge_li-v\" data-bind=\"availability\">Available</span></li></ul><div class=\"ab_sig-slot is-back\" data-about-sig=\"\"></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"ab_badge_hint\" data-badge-hint=\"\">Click the badge to flip it · drag it to swing</div></div></div><div class=\"ab_meta\"><div class=\"ab_meta_item\"><div class=\"ab_meta_label\">Callsign</div><div class=\"ab_meta_value\">AB</div></div><div class=\"ab_meta_item\"><div class=\"ab_meta_label\">Role</div><div class=\"ab_meta_value\">Designer + developer</div></div><div class=\"ab_meta_item\"><div class=\"ab_meta_label\">Training</div><div class=\"ab_meta_value\">Self-taught</div></div><div class=\"ab_meta_item\"><div class=\"ab_meta_label\">Degree</div><div class=\"ab_meta_value\">Philosophy</div></div><div class=\"ab_meta_item\"><div class=\"ab_meta_label\">Crew</div><div class=\"ab_meta_value\">Married · 1 kid</div></div><div class=\"ab_meta_item\"><div class=\"ab_meta_label\">Status</div><div class=\"ab_meta_value\"><span class=\"ab_meta_live\" data-bind=\"availability\">Available</span></div></div></div></div></div></div></section>",
 "css": ".section_about-hero{position:relative}\n.ab_planet.is-dbh.is-pilot{left:44%;right:auto;top:clamp(180px,21vw,320px);width:clamp(200px,21vw,360px);z-index:1}\n.ab_rec{display:flex;align-items:center;grid-row-gap:8px;grid-column-gap:8px;color:var(--_color---text--tertiary);letter-spacing:0.1em;text-transform:uppercase}\n.ab_rec_dot{width:8px;height:8px;border-top-left-radius:50%;border-top-right-radius:50%;border-bottom-right-radius:50%;border-bottom-left-radius:50%;background-color:#FF3B3B}\n.ab_about-hero_grid{position:relative;z-index:4;display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1.35fr) minmax(0,0.9fr);align-items:center;grid-row-gap:clamp(32px,5vw,80px);grid-column-gap:clamp(32px,5vw,80px)}\n.ab_about-hero_copy{position:relative;min-width:0}\n.ab_em{color:var(--_color---brand--signal)}\n.ab_about-hero_cta{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;grid-row-gap:12px;grid-column-gap:12px;margin-top:32px}\n.ab_badge_wrap{position:relative;justify-self:center;width:100%;max-width:380px;padding-top:clamp(60px,7vw,110px);padding-bottom:40px}\n.ab_badge_lanyard{position:absolute;left:50%;top:-40px;z-index:1;width:16px;margin-left:-8px;height:calc(clamp(60px,7vw,110px) + 58px);pointer-events:none;background-image:linear-gradient(90deg,#c9502c,#FF6A3D 30%,#ff8a5e 50%,#FF6A3D 70%,#c9502c);opacity:0.9}\n.ab_badge_clip{position:absolute;left:50%;bottom:-6px;width:34px;height:20px;margin-left:-17px;border-top-width:3px;border-top-style:solid;border-top-color:#9aa0b4;border-right-width:3px;border-right-style:solid;border-right-color:#9aa0b4;border-bottom-width:3px;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-color:#9aa0b4;border-left-width:3px;border-left-style:solid;border-left-color:#9aa0b4;border-top-style:none;border-bottom-left-radius:14px;border-bottom-right-radius:14px}\n.ab_badge_rig{position:relative;z-index:2}\n.ab_badge_swing{position:relative}\n.ab_badge{position:relative;display:block;width:100%;aspect-ratio:5 / 7.6;cursor:grab}\n.ab_badge_inner{position:absolute;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;left:0}\n.ab_badge_face{position:absolute;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;left:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;overflow-x:hidden;overflow-y:hidden;border-top-width:1px;border-top-style:solid;border-top-color:var(--_color---neutral--hair-strong);border-right-width:1px;border-right-style:solid;border-right-color:var(--_color---neutral--hair-strong);border-bottom-width:1px;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-color:var(--_color---neutral--hair-strong);border-left-width:1px;border-left-style:solid;border-left-color:var(--_color---neutral--hair-strong);background-image:linear-gradient(160deg,#171a30,#0c0e1b 60%)}\n.ab_badge_face.is-front{z-index:1}\n.ab_badge_face.is-back{display:block}\n.ab_badge_slot{position:absolute;left:50%;top:14px;width:54px;height:10px;margin-left:-27px;border-top-left-radius:6px;border-top-right-radius:6px;border-bottom-right-radius:6px;border-bottom-left-radius:6px;background-color:var(--_color---neutral--void)}\n.ab_badge_head{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;padding-top:36px;padding-right:18px;padding-bottom:12px;padding-left:18px;border-bottom-width:1px;border-bottom-style:dashed;border-bottom-color:var(--_color---neutral--hair-strong);font-size:10.5px;letter-spacing:0.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--_color---text--tertiary)}\n.ab_badge_head-text{position:relative}\n.ab_badge_id{color:var(--_color---brand--signal);font-weight:500}\n.ab_badge_mark{width:46px;height:23px;color:var(--_color---text--primary)}\n.ab_badge_photo{position:relative;display:grid;align-items:center;justify-items:center;flex-grow:1;flex-shrink:1;flex-basis:0%;min-height:0;margin-top:16px;margin-right:18px;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:18px;overflow-x:hidden;overflow-y:hidden;border-top-width:1px;border-top-style:dashed;border-top-color:var(--_color---neutral--hair-strong);border-right-width:1px;border-right-style:dashed;border-right-color:var(--_color---neutral--hair-strong);border-bottom-width:1px;border-bottom-style:dashed;border-bottom-color:var(--_color---neutral--hair-strong);border-left-width:1px;border-left-style:dashed;border-left-color:var(--_color---neutral--hair-strong)}\n.ab_badge_sil{width:46%;opacity:0.55}\n.ab_badge_ph-t{position:absolute;left:10px;bottom:8px;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:0.1em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--_color---text--tertiary)}\n.ab_badge_ph-s{position:absolute;right:10px;top:8px;font-size:10px;color:var(--_color---ui--select)}\n.ab_badge_cx{position:absolute;width:14px;height:14px;border-top-width:0;border-top-style:solid;border-top-color:#FF6A3D;border-right-width:0;border-right-style:solid;border-right-color:#FF6A3D;border-bottom-width:0;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-color:#FF6A3D;border-left-width:0;border-left-style:solid;border-left-color:#FF6A3D}\n.ab_badge_cx.is-a{left:6px;top:6px;border-left-width:1.5px;border-top-width:1.5px}\n.ab_badge_cx.is-b{right:6px;top:6px;border-right-width:1.5px;border-top-width:1.5px}\n.ab_badge_cx.is-c{left:6px;bottom:6px;border-left-width:1.5px;border-bottom-width:1.5px}\n.ab_badge_cx.is-d{right:6px;bottom:6px;border-right-width:1.5px;border-bottom-width:1.5px}\n.ab_badge_scan{position:absolute;left:0;right:0;top:-40%;height:40%;pointer-events:none;background-image:linear-gradient(180deg,transparent,rgba(255,106,61,0.16),transparent)}\n.ab_badge_name{padding-top:14px;padding-right:18px;padding-bottom:0;padding-left:18px;font-weight:900;font-stretch:118%;font-size:clamp(24px,2.2vw,30px);line-height:0.95;letter-spacing:-0.01em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--_color---text--primary)}\n.ab_badge_fields{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;grid-row-gap:8px;grid-column-gap:14px;padding-top:12px;padding-right:18px;padding-bottom:0;padding-left:18px}\n.ab_badge_field{min-width:0}\n.ab_badge_dt{font-size:9.5px;letter-spacing:0.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--_color---text--tertiary)}\n.ab_badge_dd{margin-top:2px;font-size:13.5px;line-height:1.3;color:var(--_color---text--primary)}\n.ab_badge_foot{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:flex-end;grid-row-gap:10px;grid-column-gap:10px;padding-top:12px;padding-right:18px;padding-bottom:16px;padding-left:18px}\n.ab_badge_barcode{display:flex;align-items:stretch;grid-row-gap:2px;grid-column-gap:2px;height:26px}\n.ab_badge_clear{font-size:10px;line-height:1.4;text-align:right;color:var(--_color---text--tertiary)}\n.ab_badge_back{display:flex;flex-direction:column;grid-row-gap:16px;grid-column-gap:16px;height:100%;padding-top:40px;padding-right:22px;padding-bottom:22px;padding-left:22px}\n.ab_badge_back-title{font-weight:900;font-stretch:118%;font-size:24px;line-height:1;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--_color---text--primary)}\n.ab_badge_back-text{font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.55;color:var(--_color---text--secondary)}\n.ab_badge_list{display:grid;grid-row-gap:8px;grid-column-gap:8px;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;padding-left:0;list-style-type:none;font-size:12px;color:var(--_color---text--secondary)}\n.ab_badge_li{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;grid-row-gap:12px;grid-column-gap:12px;padding-bottom:7px;border-bottom-width:1px;border-bottom-style:dashed;border-bottom-color:var(--_color---neutral--hair)}\n.ab_badge_li-v{color:var(--_color---text--primary);font-weight:500;text-align:right}\n.ab_sig-slot{display:block;width:min(260px,70%)}\n.ab_sig-slot.is-back{margin-top:auto}\n.ab_badge_hint{position:absolute;left:0;right:0;bottom:0;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:0.08em;text-align:center;white-space:nowrap;color:var(--_color---text--tertiary);pointer-events:none}\n@media screen and (max-width: 991px) {\n.ab_planet.is-dbh.is-pilot{left:auto;right:-30px;top:150px;width:240px}\n.ab_about-hero_grid{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr)}\n.ab_badge_wrap{max-width:340px;margin-top:10px}\n}\n@media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n.ab_planet.is-dbh.is-pilot{top:120px;right:-40px;width:170px}\n}\n"
}